  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/More-Horse-Armour/img/MHA.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"195\" /></div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/sA42pp6cuX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=6800be&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/Enderite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=6800be&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=6800be&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=6800be&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Patreon&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=6800be&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" height=\"28\" /></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Этот мод добавляет ещё больше конской брони в Minecraft!</h3>\n<h4>Защитите своих верховых друзей с помощью улучшенной брони</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>С конской бронёй из незерита и эндеритовой бронёй из моего мода<br/>Ваши спутники будут чувствовать себя более защищёнными во время путешествий по миру</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\"><img src=\"https://lieonlion.github.io/LieOnLion/Enderite/enderite-banner.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-armor-lieonlion\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/Gilded-Armor/img/gildedarmor-banner.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"40\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/LieOnLion\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3aef8e6d-1ea3-49c8-9dc0-0cd33e2cd9ec.webp\" width=\"838\" height=\"140\" /></a></p>",
